# Support Ticket Management System - System Architecture & Plan (Phase 1)

## 1. System Overview & Architecture

```text
React Frontend (SPA)
   ↓ (HTTP / REST APIs with Axios Interceptors)
Express Backend Server (Node.js)
   ↓ (Middleware: JWT Auth & RBAC Authorization)
Controllers & SQL Query Execution
   ↓ (mysql2 Connection Pool with Parameterized Queries)
MySQL Database (support_tickets)
```

### Layer Responsibilities
* **Frontend (React)**: User Interface, State Management (Context API), Client-side Routing (React Router v6), Axios REST API client, form validation, responsive UX.
* **Backend (Express)**: REST API routes, Request Controllers, JWT Authentication, Role-based Authorization, Request Data Validation, Standardized Error Handling.
* **Database (MySQL)**: Relational Data Persistence, Foreign Key Constraints, Indexes for Query Optimization, Transactions where appropriate.

