## 4. API Endpoints Specification

| Method | Endpoint | Access / Role | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **POST** | `/api/auth/register` | Public | Register customer account |
| **POST** | `/api/auth/login` | Public | Authenticate user & return JWT |
| **GET** | `/api/tickets` | Authenticated | Customer gets own tickets; Agent gets all tickets (supports search, filter, sort) |
| **POST** | `/api/tickets` | Customer | Create a new ticket (owner from `req.user.id`) |
| **GET** | `/api/tickets/:id` | Authenticated | Get ticket details + JOIN author & assigned agent info (ownership checked for customer) |
| **PUT** | `/api/tickets/:id` | Agent | Update status, priority, or assigned agent |
| **DELETE**| `/api/tickets/:id` | Customer / Agent | Delete open ticket (customer: own open ticket; agent: any ticket) |
| **GET** | `/api/tickets/:id/comments` | Authenticated | Get comments for ticket (after access check) |
| **POST** | `/api/tickets/:id/comments` | Authenticated | Add comment to ticket (after access check) |
| **GET** | `/api/users` | Agent | Get list of agents for ticket assignment |

