## 5. Authentication & Authorization Flow

```text
Client Application                                Express API Server
      |                                                   |
      | --- POST /api/auth/login (email, password) -----> |
      |                                                   | 1. Query user by email (parameterized)
      |                                                   | 2. bcrypt.compare(pass, hash)
      |                                                   | 3. jwt.sign({ id, role }, secret)
      | <--- 200 OK { token, user: { id, name, role } } ---|
      |                                                   |
      | --- GET /api/tickets (Header: Bearer <token>) --->|
      |                                                   | 1. authMiddleware extracts token
      |                                                   | 2. jwt.verify(token) -> req.user
      |                                                   | 3. controller checks req.user.role
      |                                                   | 4. SQL execution with WHERE filtering
      | <--- 200 OK [ tickets ] --------------------------|
```

